  "notes": [
    "Manually read all four eligible production source files and both metadata files. Root, extensions, plugin-loader, and SDK AGENTS.md instructions were read; no narrower Bonjour instructions exist. All 14 plugin-root files are partitioned into six reviewed and eight excluded records.",
    "Package metadata declares ./index.ts as its extension entrypoint and @homebridge/ciao as its installed runtime dependency. All plugin-local imports resolve within extensions/bonjour: index dynamically loads advertiser, advertiser imports ciao and errors, and ciao imports errors. These helpers are shipped production source, not test-only helpers. There is no plugin-owned or shared shipped source outside this root to add.",
    "Production and metadata under extensions/bonjour match the pinned commit. Public package exports and the five SDK facades were inspected only to establish public module/export contracts; SDK internals and the installed @homebridge/ciao dependency were not recursively audited.",
    "The runtime module is immediately narrowed to two named functions through the second destructured Promise.all result at index.ts:22-28. It does not preserve a whole namespace, so no synthetic star export is added. The unchanged functions pass through the deps object and are called at advertiser.ts:211-212. Their returned cleanup callbacks are arbitrary SDK return values and do not add calls to the original exports.",
    "api.logger is explicitly read at index.ts:42 and supplied to the local advertiser. advertiser.ts:172-174 selects its methods unchanged, with local fallback functions; subsequent logger calls retain the proven api.logger method provenance. The standalone PluginLogger Pick contributes only the SDK type reference, not an inferred API indexed-type dependency.",
    "Gateway discovery ctx fields, Bonjour option/dependency containers, error-graph callback records, @homebridge/ciao responder/service members, local return objects, and built-in string methods are not PluginRuntime or OpenClawPluginApi handles. No runtime-member findings are present.",
    "No API on/registerHook calls occur. The process exception-handler SDK helpers and third-party gateway.on event listeners are not OpenClaw hook registrations. The manifest contains activation, category, platform, descriptive, and config-schema metadata but none of the agreed contract-identity fields; it contributes no manifest-contract findings.",
    "This is a source-syntax audit: the explicit PluginLogger import and Pick reference remain type dependencies. Module plugin-entry is mixed because its import sites include both an ordinary value import and an explicit type import. All source references resolved statically; no genuine unknowns remain."
